{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0540",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“喂，往上拉！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hey, pull it up!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他使出能打穿石头的力气，十根手指牢牢抓住了打满结的绳索，扯着嗓子叫喊起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He strained with enough force to punch through stone, clutched the knotted rope tightly with all ten fingers, and began shouting at the top of his lungs.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“往上拉！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Pull it up!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "往上拉！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Pull it up!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "不往上拉，这双手是不会松开的！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you do not pull it up, these hands will never let go!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "……女人嘛，捆起来了，扔在屋里呢！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As for the woman, I tied her up and left her in the house!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "要救她，就赶快把这绳子拉上去！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you want to save her, hurry up and pull this rope up!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "绳子拉上去之前，我不会让你们碰那女人一根手指！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Until the rope is pulled up, I will not let you lay a finger on that woman!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "……你们糊里糊涂想下来，当心让铁锹敲碎脑门心……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you try coming down here without thinking, watch out or I will smash your foreheads with a shovel.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "就是上法庭也是我胜诉！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even if this goes to court, I will win!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "我可不会手软！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will not go easy on you!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "……快呵，怎么还磨磨蹭蹭的！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hurry up, why are you still dragging your feet!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "马上把我吊上去，我就不去告你们，放过你们也可以……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hoist me up right now, and I will not sue you; I might even let you off.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "非法监禁的罪名可不轻呀！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Unlawful confinement is a serious charge!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "……怎么回事？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What is going on?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00540",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "赶快往上提呀！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hurry up and pull me up!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
